# Evolution: Challenges

Spec: ChallengesIndex
Purpose:
  Registry of decision challenges — cases where new evidence conflicts
  with existing decisions. Each challenge creates a formal review process
  before any decision is superseded or deprecated.

Owns: evolution/challenges/

Structure:
  Challenges are .sdd files with @challenge.CXX IDs.
  Status field: open | review-required | resolved | rejected

ChallengeRecord:
  @challenge.C91
  decision: @decision.D88
  challenge: current evidence conflicts
  evidence: @reference.R91
  status: review-required

  ResolutionFlow:
    CONFLICT → DECISION_REQUIRED → Architect resolves → @decision.D91 created
    old decision: preserved in history (superseded)

Rules:
  [CHAL-01] Challenges MUST include conflicting evidence with provenance.
  [CHAL-02] Old decisions are preserved (superseded), never silently overwritten.
  [CHAL-03] Resolution requires review by @agent.architect.

Navigation:
  Parent: @../INDEX.sdd
  Discovery: @../discovery.sdd
  Proposals: @../proposals/INDEX.sdd
  Approved: @../approved/INDEX.sdd
  Decisions: @../../decisions/INDEX.sdd

State: +
